+## Prepared input notices
+
+`PreparedAdapterCall` and `PreparedLlmCall` optionally expose `prepareInput(options)`, returning `InputPreparationNotice` values (`key`, `summary`, `text`). The operation prepares route-specific inputs without inference I/O; it neither changes the caller's messages nor persists content. A prepared call exposing this operation refuses dispatch until preparation succeeds. The host commits notices as plugin-source messages and derives the final request from its session log. Unchanged adapters omit the operation. The interfaces are owned by [`llm/src/index.ts`](../../packages/llm/llm/src/index.ts).
+
