 ### When to choose it
 
+Prepared calls may expose `prepareInput(options)`. Call it once before streaming, commit its notices through the host, and include only logged notices in the final request. Failed, cancelled or incomplete preparation cannot authorize dispatch. The operation retains prepared attachment bytes privately; its notices carry no image bytes or storage paths.
